{"code": 200, "status": "OK", "data": [{"number": 109, "name": "سُورَةُ الكَافِرُونَ", "englishName": "Al-Kaafiroon", "englishNameTranslation": "The Disbelievers", "revelationType": "Meccan", "numberOfAyahs": 6, "ayahs": [{"number": 6208, "text": "بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ قُلْ يَٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْكَٰفِرُونَ", "numberInSurah": 1, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6209, "text": "لَآ أَعْبُدُ مَا تَعْبُدُونَ", "numberInSurah": 2, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6210, "text": "وَلَآ أَنتُمْ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعْبُدُ", "numberInSurah": 3, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6211, "text": "وَلَآ أَنَا۠ عَابِدٌۭ مَّا عَبَدتُّمْ", "numberInSurah": 4, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6212, "text": "وَلَآ أَنتُمْ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعْبُدُ", "numberInSurah": 5, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6213, "text": "لَكُمْ دِينُكُمْ وَلِىَ دِينِ", "numberInSurah": 6, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}], "edition": {"identifier": "quran-uthmani", "language": "ar", "name": "القرآن الكريم برسم العثماني (uthmani)", "englishName": "Uthmani", "format": "text", "type": "quran", "direction": "rtl"}}, {"number": 109, "name": "سُورَةُ الكَافِرُونَ", "englishName": "Al-Kaafiroon", "englishNameTranslation": "The Disbelievers", "revelationType": "Meccan", "numberOfAyahs": 6, "ayahs": [{"number": 6208, "text": "Скажи: «О неверующие!", "numberInSurah": 1, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6209, "text": "Я не поклоняюсь тому, чему поклоняетесь вы,", "numberInSurah": 2, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6210, "text": "а вы не поклоняетесь Тому, Кому поклоняюсь я.", "numberInSurah": 3, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6211, "text": "Я не поклоняюсь так, как поклоняетесь вы (или тому, чему поклоняетесь вы),", "numberInSurah": 4, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6212, "text": "а вы не поклоняетесь так, как поклоняюсь я (или Тому, Кому поклоняюсь я).", "numberInSurah": 5, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6213, "text": "У вас есть ваша религия, а у меня - моя!».", "numberInSurah": 6, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}], "edition": {"identifier": "ru.kuliev", "language": "ru", "name": "Кулиев", "englishName": "Elmir Kuliev", "format": "text", "type": "translation", "direction": "ltr"}}, {"number": 109, "name": "سُورَةُ الكَافِرُونَ", "englishName": "Al-Kaafiroon", "englishNameTranslation": "The Disbelievers", "revelationType": "Meccan", "numberOfAyahs": 6, "ayahs": [{"number": 6208, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6208.mp3", "audioSecondary": ["https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6208.mp3"], "text": "بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ قُلْ يَٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْكَٰفِرُونَ", "numberInSurah": 1, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6209, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6209.mp3", "audioSecondary": ["https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6209.mp3"], "text": "لَآ أَعْبُدُ مَا تَعْبُدُونَ", "numberInSurah": 2, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 603, "ruku": 551, "hizbQuarter": 240, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6210, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6210.mp3", "audioSecondary": ["https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6210.mp3"], 